# Contacts

> Oracle reads this when writing communications or referencing people.
> The more context you give per contact, the better Oracle calibrates tone and content.
> Update whenever a relationship changes.

---

## How to use this file

Oracle uses contacts to:
- Know who someone is when you mention them
- Calibrate tone in emails (formal/informal, warm/businesslike)
- Understand the relationship history and what to avoid
- Draft contextually appropriate follow-ups

